Author reports that the opaque status surface ignores the dark system theme.
Replace hard-coded light colors with CSS Canvas/CanvasText and advertise both
light and dark color schemes. Keep the background opaque and preserve wrapping.
No scheduler or extraction change.

The isolated smoke driver can emulate a dark system preference via --dark;
it checks the actual media query and computed foreground/background contrast
in the unmodified production extension. Deliver a separately versioned XPI in
the author's home, without installing into the running Zotero profile.

Passing dark-system native Zotero evidence and exact source digests:
`bench/results/sdt-sitter-launch-2026-09-05/dark-theme.json`.
